No upstream source is patched. fetch-upstream.py verifies source archive hashes.
The Docker image includes the fetched source and notices, including the engine's
source files and submodule references. The upstream release also publishes a
complete source archive containing the native dependencies needed to rebuild WASM.
For redistribution of the bundled engine, provide its corresponding complete
source from the matching upstream release or pinned submodules under the GPL.

